  Deliberately absent
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    No embedding or reranking weights are shipped. ADR-030 moved both to provider
    APIs, so bge-m3 and bge-reranker-v2-m3 are not in the image and not listed.

    Surya (OCR) and OmniDocBench (evaluation) are NOT shipped and must not be:
    Surya's weights are modified AI Pubs OpenRAIL-M with an operator-revenue cap
    and a competing-product clause, and OmniDocBench is research-only. Both are on
    the deny side of scripts/security/policy/licences.toml.

